      "Detachment§Exhibition Of Slaughter": {
        "keywords": {
          "Role": [
            "Reconnaissance"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**EXACTING CRUELTY**\n\nFriendly **WYCH CULT** units' melee attacks have **[LETHAL HITS:** **non-****MONSTER/VEHICLE]**.\nThis **detachment** has the **WYCH CULT** tag and cannot be taken with another **WYCH CULT** **detachment**.",
