      "Stratagem§A Challenge Met": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Spectacle of Spite"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a **fall-back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly unengaged **WYCH CULT** unit that is within 6\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Declare a charge with your unit. When selecting **charge targets**, you can only select enemy units that made a **fall-back move** this phase and are within the **maximum distance**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Acrobatic Display": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Exhibition Of Slaughter"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **WYCH CULT** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WYCH CULT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has 5+ **InSv**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Berserk Fugue": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Spectacle of Spite"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WYCH CULT** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
      "Stratagem§Connoisseurs of Pain": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Covenite Coterie"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Spend 1 Pain Token. Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1. At the end of the phase, if your unit is still on the battlefield and it is a **HAEMONCULUS COVENS** unit, you gain 1 Pain Token."
      },
      "Stratagem§Dance Macabre": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Reaper's Wager"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI INFANTRY** or **HARLEQUINS INFANTRY** unit from your army that is within 8\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to D6\". If your unit is currently losing the wager, it can make a Normal move of up to 6\" instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Dark Harvest": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Realspace Raiders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to two **WRACKS** units from your army, or one other **DRUKHARI** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in each of those units have the **[LETHAL HITS]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Deadly Debut": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Spectacle of Spite"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI** unit from your army that made a Charge move this turn and has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[LETHAL HITS]** ability. If your unit is a **WYCHES** unit, until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in your unit by 1 as well."
      },
      "Stratagem§Deadly Deceivers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Kabalite Cartel"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **KABAL** or **BLADES FOR HIRE** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Distillers of Fear": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Covenite Coterie"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HAEMONCULUS COVENS** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit that is Battle-shocked, that attack has the **[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Double-cross": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Kabalite Cartel"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **KABAL** or **BLADES FOR HIRE** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks, and one friendly **DRUKHARI** unit (excluding **VEHICLES**).\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time you would allocate an attack to a model in your **KABAL** or **BLADES FOR HIRE** unit, if your **DRUKHARI** unit is within Engagement Range of the attacking model, no saving throw is made for that attack; instead, your **DRUKHARI** unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§Eager for the Kill": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Realspace Raiders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to two **WYCHES** units from your army, or one other **DRUKHARI** unit from your army, that have not been selected to move this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time one of those units Advances, do not make an Advance roll for it. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6\" to the Move characteristic of models in that unit (this is not cumulative with the **REAVERS**’ Matchless Swiftness ability)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Enemies Without Number": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Kabalite Cartel"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase, just after you complete a Contract (see Murderous Agenda Detachment rule).\n\n**TARGET:** One **ARCHON WARLORD** from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one new Contract from those listed in the Murderous Agenda Detachment rule (this can be one you have already completed), then select one unit from your opponent’s army that is on the battlefield and matches the ‘Contract’ description in that Contract. Until that Contract is completed, that unit is your Contract unit and the Murderous Agenda Detachment rule applies as normal."
      },
      "Stratagem§Enfolding Nightmare": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Covenite Coterie"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HAEMONCULUS COVENS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **surge move** of up to D6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fateful Role": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Reaper's Wager"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI** or **HARLEQUINS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6, adding 1 to the result if that unit is losing the wager: on a 4+, do not remove it from play. That destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
      "Stratagem§Feigned Weakness": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Spectacle of Spite"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **DRUKHARI** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **DRUKHARI** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fighting Shadows": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Realspace Raiders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI** unit from your army (excluding **HAEMONCULUS COVENS** units) that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Insensible to Pain": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Realspace Raiders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HAEMONCULUS COVENS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§Instinctive Spite": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Realspace Raiders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase or the start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to two **DRUKHARI BATTLELINE** units from your army, or one other **DRUKHARI** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** You can spend 1 Pain token. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in each of those units makes an attack that targets an enemy unit that is Below Half-strength, add 1 to the Hit roll. If you spent 1 Pain token, add 1 to the Wound roll as well."
      },
      "Stratagem§Making a Point": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Kabalite Cartel"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **KABALITE WARRIORS** or **HAND OF THE ARCHON** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, improve the Ballistic Skill and Armour Penetration characteristics of ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Malicious Frenzy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Reaper's Wager"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI** or **HARLEQUINS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select **[LETHAL HITS]** or **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**. Until the end of the phase, weapons equipped by models in your unit have the selected ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Murderer's Circus": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Reaper's Wager"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI** or **HARLEQUINS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Night Shield": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Skysplinter Assault"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI VEHICLE** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a 4+ invulnerable save."
      },
      "Stratagem§Poisoner’s Art": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Covenite Coterie"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after a **HAEMONCULUS COVENS** unit from your army has fought.\n\n**TARGET:** That **HAEMONCULUS COVENS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit (excluding **VEHICLES**) hit by one or more of your unit’s attacks this phase. Until the end of the battle, that enemy unit is poisoned. At the start of each Command phase, roll one D6 for each poisoned unit on the battlefield: on a 4+, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Postmortality": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Covenite Coterie"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **HAEMONCULUS** model from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that model even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Spend 1-3 Pain tokens. At the end of the phase, set up the **destroyed** model on the battlefield, **unengaged** and as close as possible to where it was **destroyed**. That model is not part of an **attached** unit and its unit has a **starting strength** of 1. That model has a number of wounds remaining equal to the number of Pain tokens you just spent.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot use this Stratagem if you have 0 Pain tokens, and you cannot target the same **HAEMONCULUS** model with this Stratagem more than once per battle."
      },
      "Stratagem§Pounce on the Prey": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Skysplinter Assault"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **DRUKHARI INFANTRY** unit from your army disembarks from a **TRANSPORT** that made a Normal move this phase.\n\n**TARGET:** That **INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to declare a charge."
      },
      "Stratagem§Preternatural Agility": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Spectacle of Spite"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Movement or Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WYCH CULT** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time your unit makes a Normal, Advance or Charge move, you can ignore any or all modifiers to its Move characteristic and to Advance and Charge rolls made for it and, until the end of the turn, each time a model in your unit makes such a move, it can move horizontally through models (when doing so, such a model can move within Engagement Range of such models but cannot end a Normal or Advance move within Engagement Range of them)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Raid and Fade": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Realspace Raiders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to two **KABALITE WARRIORS** units from your army, or one other **DRUKHARI** unit from your army (excluding **SCOURGES** and **AIRCRAFT**).\n\n**EFFECT:** Each of those units can make a Normal move of up to 6\".\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot select units that are within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units. Until the end of the turn, those units are not eligible to declare a charge."
      },
      "Stratagem§Scintillating Tempo": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Reaper's Wager"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase or your Charge phase, just after a **DRUKHARI** or **HARLEQUINS** unit from your army is selected to make a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, is set up on the battlefield, or declares a charge.\n\n**TARGET:** That unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, enemy units cannot use the Fire Overwatch Stratagem to shoot at your unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Shorten the Odds": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Reaper's Wager"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **DRUKHARI** or **HARLEQUINS** unit from your army has Advanced.\n\n**TARGET:** That unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Stratagem§Skyborne Annihilation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Skysplinter Assault"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase and that disembarked from a **TRANSPORT** this turn.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability, or the **[SUSTAINED HITS 2]** ability if your unit is a **KABALITE WARRIORS** or **HAND OF THE ARCHON** unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Swooping Mockery": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Skysplinter Assault"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI TRANSPORT** from your army that is within 8\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your **TRANSPORT** can make a Normal move of up to 6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Symphony of Suffering": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Covenite Coterie"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after a **DRUKHARI** unit from your army destroys an enemy unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **DRUKHARI** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each enemy unit within 9\" of and visible to your unit must take a Battle-shock test, subtracting 1 from that test if your unit is a **HAEMONCULUS COVENS** unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Tailored Toxins": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Kabalite Cartel"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **KABAL** or **BLADES FOR HIRE** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets your Contract unit, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Taken Alive": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Kabalite Cartel"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll. If your Contract unit is destroyed as a result of those attacks, every unit in your opponent’s army must take a Battle-shock test. You cannot gain more than 3 Pain tokens as a result of failed Battle-shock tests caused by this Stratagem."
      },
      "Stratagem§Vicious Blades": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Skysplinter Assault"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after a **DRUKHARI TRANSPORT** from your army has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** That **TRANSPORT**.\n\n**EFFECT:** After your **TRANSPORT** has fought, select one enemy unit that was the target of one or more of those attacks and roll one D6 for each model embarked within your **TRANSPORT**, adding 1 to the result if that embarked model is a **WRACKS** model: for each 5+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Wraithlike Retreat": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Drukhari",
            "Skysplinter Assault"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DRUKHARI INFANTRY** unit from your army that fought this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal or Fall Back move, but unless it is a **WYCHES** unit, it must end that move wholly within 3\" horizontally and 5\" vertically of a friendly **DRUKHARI TRANSPORT** and must embark within that **TRANSPORT** at the end of that move (otherwise, it cannot make that move). Your unit can embark within that **TRANSPORT** in a turn it disembarked from that **TRANSPORT**."
      },
